From ce25831d973d71e027c2c7337cb84286e5f46ef2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Robert Christie <rgcgeog@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 2 Oct 2026 14:58:03 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] feat(gpgpu): clear and readback copy-node factories;
 preflight reports uninitialized transient reads

createGPUClearBufferCommandNode() zeroes a graph buffer range with CommandEncoder.clearBuffer(); createGPUReadbackCommandNode() copies a transient or imported range into a GPUReadbackTicket at its place in the schedule. CompiledGPUCommandGraph.preflight.uninitializedTransientReads lists transient buffers whose first scheduled access is a read.
